:: RobinTemple Evaluation
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin 1>><<npc Jordan 2>><<person1>>
<<if $templePromised isnot '' and ($templePromised isnot 'Sydney' or !$RobinTemple.dual_promise)>>
  <<robin-temple-promise-blocked>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to Robin', '回到罗宾的座位'] 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<elseif $RobinTemple.stage isnot 'member' or $robinromance isnot 1 or $RobinTemple.punish
  or $temple_rank is undefined or $temple_rank is 'prospective'
  or C.npc.Robin.conviction lt 80 or Time.dayState is 'night' or Time.dayState is 'dusk'
  or ($RobinTemple.evaluation_day gte 0 and Time.days lt $RobinTemple.evaluation_day + 30)>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The evaluation must wait until Jordan is available, you are both full members, and the waiting period has ended.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      评估需要等约旦到场、你们都成为正式成员，并且等待期结束后才能开始。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to Robin', '回到罗宾的座位'] 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if !$robinSeen.includes("evaluation")>>
        You tell Robin you're ready. <<He>> takes a deep breath, and the pair of you approach Jordan.
        <br><br>
        <<nnpc_He "Jordan">> turns to greet you as you near. "Welcome back," <<nnpc_he "Jordan">> says. Robin's grip on your hand tightens.
        <br><br>
        "W-we'd like to make a request," Robin stammers. You give <<him>> a reassuring look, and <<his>> doubt rapidly fades. "We... really love each other. A lot. We wanted to request a... a pardon from the First Vow, permission to..." Robin looks down, <<his>> face heating up. Jordan smiles.
        <br><br>
        "I understand. You know the rules, Robin. A union of two of our members will be permitted if, and only if, the love between the two is deemed to be absolutely pure of heart, and they undergo a rite of promise or marriage. Now, you're both still in school, yes? I'd personally advise against marriage at this time."
        <br><br>
        You can feel Robin's pulse through <<his>> hand. "Y-yes, we agree." <<He>> steps forward, and motions for you to do the same. "We'd like to be evaluated for the rite of promise."
      <<else>>
        You tell Robin you're ready. The two of you approach Jordan again. "Welcome back," <<nnpc_he "Jordan">> says. "I take it you're here to be evaluated again?" You both nod.
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      Jordan gives you both a solemn smile. "Please come with me. You're both up to date on your chastity exams, so we can skip that step. For now." <<nnpc_He "Jordan">> begins to lead you out of the main hall and into a small room.
      <br><br>
      <<link [[Next|RobinTemple Evaluation Records]]>><<pass 5>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_day to Time.days>><</link>>
      <br>

    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if !$robinSeen.includes("evaluation")>>
        你告诉罗宾你准备好了。<<He>>听罢深吸一口气，和你一起走向约旦。
        <br><br>
        约旦见你们走来，向你们打招呼。"欢迎回来。" 罗宾紧紧握住了你的手。
        <br><br>
        "我，我们想提出一个申请，"罗宾断断续续地说着。你给了<<he>>一个安抚的目光，<<he>>便很快不再迟疑。"我们……真的很爱彼此，真的真的。我们想申请一个——一个对于第一誓约的赦免。就是允许……"罗宾埋下头，脸唰的一下变红了。约旦笑了。
        <br><br>
        "我明白了。你也知道规矩，罗宾。当且仅当两个人之间的爱被认为是纯洁无瑕的，并且他们经历了结为伴侣或结婚的仪式时，两个人的结合才被允许。你们俩都还在上学，对吧？我个人建议不要在这个时候结婚。"
        <br><br>
        你能感受到罗宾手掌下跳动的脉搏。“是，是的，我们想好了，”<<He>>拉着你一起向前一步，“我们想进行承诺仪式的评估程序。”
      <<else>>
        你告诉罗宾你准备好了，于是你们再次走向约旦。"欢迎回来，"<<nnpc_he "Jordan">>说，"我想你们是来进行评估的吧？"你们点点头。
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      约旦对你们露出庄严的微笑。"请和我来，你们二人都通过了定期的贞洁测试，所以我们可以跳过这个步骤。至于现在……"<<nnpc_He "Jordan">>带你们走出主厅，来到一个小房间。
      <br><br>
      <<link [[继续|RobinTemple Evaluation Records]]>><<pass 5>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_day to Time.days>><</link>>
      <br>

  <</language>>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Evaluation Records
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks to 0>>

    <<npc "Jordan" 2>><<person2>><<generate3>><<person3>>
    "The evaluation will focus on the aspects of your bond with each other, as well as your individual contributions to the order," Jordan explains as <<person2>><<he>> shuts the door behind you. <<He>> motions for you and Robin to take seats at an ornate table as <<he>> produces a small notebook from <<his>> robes.
    <<if $robinSeen.includes("evaluation")>>
      "You've already answered these questions, but since this is a fresh evaluation, I must repeat them."
    <<else>>
      <<set $robinSeen.pushUnique("evaluation")>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if $RobinTemple.grace gte 90>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
      Jordan asks about your devotion to the temple. <span class='green'>Robin's answers please Jordan.</span> <<He>> turns to ask you the same questions.
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.grace gte 75>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 5>>
      Jordan asks about your devotion to the temple. <span class='teal'>Jordan approves of Robin's contribution.</span> <<He>> turns to ask you the same questions.
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.grace gte 60>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 2>>
      Jordan asks about your devotion to the temple. <span class='lblue'>Jordan acknowledges Robin's contribution.</span> <<He>> turns to ask you the same questions.
    <<else>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 5>>
      Jordan asks about your devotion to the temple. <span class='red'>Jordan questions Robin's contribution.</span> <<He>> turns to ask you the same questions.
    <</if>>
    <br>

    <br>
    <<if $grace gte 90>>
      "Your devotion is remarkable, as has been proven in the past. <span class="green">You're a credit to our faith, and every one of us could learn from you.</span> I have faith that you will pass this evaluation already, but we must continue on."
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 20>>
    <<elseif $grace gte 50>>
      "<span class="teal">You've been an upstanding member of our faith.</span> I trust your words."
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
    <<elseif $grace gte 1>>
      "<span class="lblue">You've been a satisfactory member of our faith.</span> I trust your dedication, but you must strive for improvement still."
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 5>>
    <<else>>
      <span class="red">"I question your true devotion,"</span> <<he>> says. "We know you can do better."
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if $worn.head.name.includes("rose wedding") or $worn.upper.name.includes("rose wedding")>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 5>>
      <<He>> runs <<his>> thumb against the roses on your clothes. "While not necessarily appropriate for this Rite, I can appreciate that you're wearing your heart on your sleeve with this wedding attire."
      <br><br>
      Robin blushes. "I... I hope to see <<phim>> wearing that again some day."
      <br><br>
    <</if>>
    Jordan produces a small bell from <<his>> robes, and rings it four times. <<person3>>An older <<monk>> enters the room, and nods to Jordan. "Please stand," the <<monk>> says.
    <<He>> examines Robin very closely, although <<person1>><<he>> shows no discomfort.<<person3>>
    <br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.conviction gte 120>>
      "<span class="green">You are as pure as the day you joined us,</span> <<nnpc_brother "Robin">> Robin. May you stay this way forevermore," the <<monk>> says through a hearty smile.
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
    <<else>>
      "<span class="blue">I sense your purity has begun to slip,</span> <<nnpc_brother "Robin">> Robin. Take care that your love for this <<temple_title>> does not corrupt you." Robin flinches at <<his>> words.
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    The <<monk>> approaches you.
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Next|RobinTemple Evaluation Belief]]>><</link>>
    <br>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks to 0>>

    <<npc "Jordan" 2>><<person2>><<generate3>><<person3>>
    "评估的重点会集中在你们之间的羁绊和对神殿的贡献上。"约旦一边解释，一边关上了身后的门。<<person2>><<He>>指引你们两人在一张华丽的桌前落了座，自己从斗篷里拿出一个小号笔记本。
    <<if $robinSeen.includes("evaluation")>>
      "你们已经回答过这些问题了，但因为这是一次全新的评估，所以我仍然会提同样的问题。"
    <<else>>
      <<set $robinSeen.pushUnique("evaluation")>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if $RobinTemple.grace gte 90>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
      约旦开始询问你们对神殿的奉献。<span class='green'>罗宾的回答让约旦十分满意。</span><<He>>转向你，问了一些相同的问题。
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.grace gte 75>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 5>>
      约旦开始询问你们对神殿的奉献。<span class='teal'>约旦认可罗宾的贡献。</span><<He>>转向你，问了一些相同的问题。
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.grace gte 60>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 2>>
      约旦开始询问你们对神殿的奉献。<span class='lblue'>约旦承认罗宾的贡献。</span><<He>>转向你，问了一些相同的问题。
    <<else>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 5>>
      约旦开始询问你们对神殿的奉献。<span class='red'>约旦认为罗宾的贡献有待提高。</span><<He>>转向你，问了一些相同的问题。
    <</if>>
    <br>

    <<if $grace gte 90>>
      "你的奉献十分出众，这一点在过去已经得到了证明。<span class="green">你是我们信仰的骄傲，每个人都能够向你学习。</span>我完全相信你可以通过评估，但我们还是得走程序。"
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 20>>
    <<elseif $grace gte 50>>
      "<span class="teal">你一直是我们信仰中的杰出成员，</span>我相信你的话。"
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
    <<elseif $grace gte 1>>
      "<span class="lblue">你一直是我们信仰中的优良成员。</span>我认可你的贡献，但你仍需努力修炼自己。"
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 5>>
    <<else>>
      <span class="red">“你的贡献有待商榷，”</span><<he>>说，“我们都知道你可以做得更好。”
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if $worn.head.name.includes("rose wedding") or $worn.upper.name.includes("rose wedding")>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 5>>
      <<He>>用拇指轻轻摩挲着你衣服上的玫瑰花纹，“虽然这身婚纱不太适合这场仪式，但我能明白，你是把心意都直白地穿在了身上。”
      <br><br>
      罗宾的脸唰的一下变红了。“我……我希望某天能看到<<phim>>再次穿上这件衣服。”
      <br><br>
    <</if>>
    <<He>>从斗篷里拿出一枚小铃铛摇了几次。<<person3>>一个年长的<<monk>>进入房间，向约旦点点头。“请站直了。”那个<<monk>>说。
    <<He>>非常仔细地打量罗宾，尽管<<person1>><<he>>没表现出丝毫不适。<<person3>>
    <br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.conviction gte 120>>
      "<span class="green">你和加入我们那天一样纯洁，</span>罗宾<<nnpc_brother "Robin">>。祝你永远保持这样。"<<monk>>露出了亲和的微笑。
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
    <<else>>
      “<span class="blue">我感觉你的纯洁有减损的趋势，</span>罗宾<<nnpc_brother "Robin">>。要注意，别让你对这位<<temple_title>>的爱将你拉入堕落。”罗宾听着<<his>>的话，神态有些退缩。
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    在评估完罗宾之后，那个<<monk>>转身走向了你。
    <br><br>
    <<link [[继续|RobinTemple Evaluation Belief]]>><</link>>
    <br>
<</language>>

:: RobinTemple Evaluation Belief
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<He>> begins to look you over.
    <<if $angel gte 6>>
      <<His>> eyes slowly widen, and after a moment, <<he>> steps back and regards you with awe. "<span class="gold">This one is... radiant.</span> A true beacon of purity." <<He>> turns to Jordan. "I have faith that this one will take the vow seriously." <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 20>>
    <<elseif $fallenangel gte 2 or $demon gte 6>>
      <<He>> slowly frowns. "<span class="red">This one is... dirty.</span> Tragic."
      <<if $fallenangel gte 2 and $forgiveintro is 1>>
        <br><br>
        Jordan smiles faintly. "<<pShe>> has already confessed to me <<pher>> soil, and seeks to improve <<pherself>>. If anything, <span class="green"><<pher>> willingness to admit <<pher>> sin and desire to improve <<pherself>> is something to admire</span>."
        <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 5>>
      <<else>>
        <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 10>>
      <</if>>
    <<elseif $purity gte 999>>
      <<His>> face brightens up as <<he>> examines you head to toe. <span class="green">"Your dedication to purity is impressive."</span> <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 15>>
    <<elseif $purity gte 900>>
      <<He>> smiles as <<he>> examines you head to toe. <span class="lblue">"Your dedication to purity is commendable."</span> <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
    <<elseif $purity gte 500>>
      <<His>> expression remains stern as <<he>> examines you head to toe. "<span class="purple">Your dedication to purity is... sub-par.</span> You should strive to improve yourself."
    <<else>>
      <<He>> frowns as <<he>> regards you. <span class="red">"A pity. Your purity has faded."</span> <<He>> turns to Jordan. "This one should be made to atone before any such rite is permitted, but the say is not mine." <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 5>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    Jordan nods to the <<monk>>, who bows and leaves the room. "The next section of the examination will require you two to be separated. Please come with me." Jordan leads you into a separate, adjacent room with an identical ornate table. "Please wait here while I administer Robin's part of the exam."
    <br><br>
    <<endevent>><<npc "Robin" 1>><<person1>><<npc "Jordan" 2>><<person2>>
    <<link [[Wait (0:15)|RobinTemple Evaluation Questions]]>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase to 1>><<pass 15>><</link>>
    <br>
    <<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 700>>
    <<lanLink ['Eavesdrop on Jordan and Robin', '偷听约旦与罗宾的谈话'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Eavesdrop'>><</lanLink>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><br>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<he>>仔细地把你打量了一番
    <<if $angel gte 6>>
      ，<<His>>的眼睛缓缓放大，一会儿之后，<<he>>后退几步，惊讶地注视着你。"<span class="gold">这个人……在发着圣光。</span>一座真正的纯洁的灯塔。"<<He>>转向约旦，"我完全相信此人会严肃地对待这个誓约。"<<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 20>>
    <<elseif $fallenangel gte 2 or $demon gte 6>>
      ，缓缓地皱起了眉头。"<span class="red">这个人……一团污秽。</span>真可悲。"
      <<if $fallenangel gte 2 and $forgiveintro is 1>>
        <br><br>
        约旦露出了微笑。“<<pShe>>已经向我坦白了<<pher>>的错误，并希望改进自己。如果要评价的话，<span class="green"><<pher>>愿意承认错误，并渴望改正这点是值得赞许的</span>。”
        <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 5>>
      <<else>>
        <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 10>>
      <</if>>
    <<elseif $purity gte 999>>
      <<He>>从头到脚审视了你一番，脸上露出轻快的笑容。<span class="green">“你对纯洁的奉献，着实令人倾佩。”</span><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 15>>
    <<elseif $purity gte 900>>
      <<He>>从头到脚审视了你一番，对你微微一笑。<span class="lblue">“你对纯洁的奉献，值得赞许。”</span><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
    <<elseif $purity gte 500>>
      <<He>>从头到脚审视了你一番，神情始终非常严肃。"<span class="purple">你对纯洁的奉献……有所欠缺，</span>你应该努力鞭策自己。"
    <<else>>
      <<He>>皱着眉头审视着你。<span class="red">“可惜，你的纯洁已经散尽。”</span><<He>>转向约旦，“这个人应该先赎罪，之后才能参与仪式，但决定不在我。”<<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 5>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    约旦对<<monk>>点点头，那人鞠了一躬，随即离开了房间。"接下来的部分需要你们分开进行测试，请随我来。"约旦带你走向一个紧邻的单间，里面同样放着一张华丽的桌子。"请在这儿等一会儿，我需要先对罗宾进行测试。"
    <br><br>
    <<endevent>><<npc "Robin" 1>><<person1>><<npc "Jordan" 2>><<person2>>
    <<link [[等待 (0:15)|RobinTemple Evaluation Questions]]>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase to 1>><<pass 15>><</link>>
    <br>
    <<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 700>>
    <<lanLink ['Eavesdrop on Jordan and Robin', '偷听约旦与罗宾的谈话'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Eavesdrop'>><</lanLink>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><br>
<</language>>

:: RobinTemple Evaluation Questions
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<if $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase is 1>>
      You sit and wait for Jordan to return. You spend the time looking at the various ornate patterns carved into the table.
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase is 2>>
      You sit and wait for Jordan to return, helpless to do much else. You spend the time looking at the various ornate patterns carved into the table, wondering what other tricks may be hidden within.
    <<else>>
      You hear Jordan approach the door, and you quickly return to your seat.
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    Jordan enters the room, still smiling. "Apologies for the wait. Please answer me honestly, no matter the question," <<person2>><<he>> says as <<he>> sits opposite to you. <<He>> flips <<his>> notebook to a fresh page.
    <br><br>
    "Where did you and Robin grow up together?"
    <br><br>

    <<lanLink ['At the orphanage', '在孤儿院'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Answer'>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer to 'orphanage'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<lanLink ['At school', '在学校'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Answer'>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer to 'school'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<lanLink ["Say you don't remember", '说你不记得了'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Answer'>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer to 'forgot'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<if $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase is 1>>
      你坐等约旦回来，盯着桌上那雕刻华丽的花纹发呆。
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase is 2>>
      你坐等约旦回来，百无聊赖，只好一直盯着桌面上雕刻的华丽花纹发呆，希望能发现其它可能藏在哪儿的机关。
    <<else>>
      你听见约旦走近门口，于是迅速跑回座位。
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    约旦进入房间，脸上仍挂着微笑。"抱歉久等了，现在请诚实地回答我的提问，不论内容是什么。"<<person2>><<he>>说着坐到了你对面，翻开了<<he>>的笔记。
    <br><br>
    "你和罗宾在哪里一起长大？"
    <br><br>

    <<lanLink ['At the orphanage', '在孤儿院'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Answer'>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer to 'orphanage'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<lanLink ['At school', '在学校'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Answer'>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer to 'school'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<lanLink ["Say you don't remember", '说你不记得了'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Answer'>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer to 'forgot'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</language>>

:: RobinTemple Evaluation Answer
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<if $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer is "orphanage">>
      Jordan nods, writing in <<his>> notebook. "Your memory serves well." <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer is "forgot">>
      Jordan pauses and frowns. "That seems important to remember." <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 5>>
    <<else>>
      Jordan pauses and frowns. "Robin told me something different."
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<He>> reaches for your hand, producing a ring sizer from <<his>> robes. "I need your ring size in the event you pass." You allow <<him>> to measure your ring finger as <<he>> continues.
    <br><br>
    "Do you understand the requirements and implications of the vow of promise?" You shake your head. "It's a sacred bond between two members of our order that show pure love between one another. It allows them to be exempt from their chastity vows, but only with each other. We will know if either of you is unfaithful."
    <<He>> finds your ring size. "This bond does not protect your purity, hence the strict requirements. Such a privilege is reserved for marriage in our faith. Your chastity exams will be taken simultaneously, when possible. Should either one of you fail your chastity exam after your new vow, <span class="red">you will both be punished as one.</span>"
    <br><br>
    Jordan's face has become serious. "Tell me, my child. Are you certain it is not lust, but love that drives you to take this vow?"
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Yes|RobinTemple Evaluation Contact]]>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase to 1>><</link>>
    <br>
    <<link [[No|RobinTemple Evaluation Contact]]>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase to 2>><</link>>
    <br>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<if $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer is "orphanage">>
      约旦点点头，写在了<<his>>的笔记本上。"你的记性很好嘛。"<<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer is "forgot">>
      约旦顿了顿，皱起眉头。"那应该是值得记住的东西。"<<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 5>>
    <<else>>
      约旦顿了顿，皱起了眉头。"罗宾不是这么说的。"
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<He>>抓上你的手，从斗篷里拿出一个指围尺。"我需要量一下你的指围，以便在你通过评估后制作戒指。"<<he>>用尺子量了量你的无名指。
    <br><br>
    "你应该明白承诺誓约的要求和限制吧？"你摇摇头，"这是两名信徒间神圣的结合，展现的是伴侣双方纯洁的爱意。结为伴侣免除了守洁的义务，但也仅限你们之间。要是你们任何一人不忠，我们会知道的。"
    <<He>>量好了你的指围，"这种联结并不能保护你们的纯洁，因此有着严格的规定。在我们的信仰中，这样的特权是为婚姻而保留的。你们的贞洁测试将在可能的情况下同时进行，如果你们中的任何一人在誓言过后未能通过贞洁测试，<span class="red">你们将会一同受罚。</span>"
    <br><br>
    约旦的表情更加严肃起来。"告诉我，我的孩子。你确定你不是因为欲望，而是因为对对方的爱，才许下这个承诺的？"
    <br><br>
    <<link [[是的|RobinTemple Evaluation Contact]]>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase to 1>><</link>>
    <br>
    <<link [[不是|RobinTemple Evaluation Contact]]>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase to 2>><</link>>
    <br>
<</language>>

:: RobinTemple Evaluation Result
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<effects>>
    Jordan steps away from the table.
    <<if $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase is 1>>
      "Honesty is an important virtue. Thank you." <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
    <<else>>
      "Honesty is an important virtue. I'm disappointed that one of you has lied to me." <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 10>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks gte 60>>
      "I have little doubt that you'll take this seriously. Congratulations. <span class="green">You've both passed</span><<if $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase isnot 1>>, despite that final lie<</if>>."
      <br><br>
      <<link [[Next|RobinTemple Promise Rite]]>><<set $RobinTemple.stage to 'approved'>><</link>>
      <br>
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks gte 40>>
      "You are devoted. That much is plain. However, I still question your true motivations. I will administer an off-schedule chastity exam, and should you still be found pure, you will pass this evaluation. Otherwise... <span class="blue">you will be purified, and allowed to take this test again in one month's time.</span>"
      <br><br>
      <<link [[Allow examination|RobinTemple Evaluation Examination]]>><</link>>
      <br>
      <<link [[Refuse examination|RobinTemple Evaluation Refuse]]>><</link>>
      <br>
      <<link [[Say you are impure|RobinTemple Evaluation Admit]]>><</link>>
      <br>
    <<else>>
      "I am sorry, but <span class="red">you've failed this evaluation.</span> I cannot in good faith allow your union in your current state. <span class="blue">However, you will be allowed to take this test again in one month's time.</span>"
      <br><br>
      <<link [[Next|RobinTemple Evaluation Fail]]>><</link>>
      <br>
    <</if>>
    <<unset $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks>><<unset $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<effects>>
    约旦离开了桌子。
    <<if $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase is 1>>
      "诚实是一种重要的美德，谢谢你。"<<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
    <<else>>
      "诚实是一种重要的美德，我很失望你们有人撒了慌。"<<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 10>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks gte 60>>
      "我不会怀疑你们对待这份承诺的诚意了，恭喜。<span class="green">你们都通过了</span><<if $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase isnot 1>>，尽管最后撒了谎<</if>>。"
      <br><br>
      <<link [[继续|RobinTemple Promise Rite]]>><<set $RobinTemple.stage to 'approved'>><</link>>
      <br>
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks gte 40>>
      “你确实做出了非常大的贡献，这一点有目共睹。然而，我仍然对你的真正动机表示怀疑，因此我将进行一次非计划的贞洁测试，如果你依然纯洁无瑕，你将通过这次评估。否则……<span class="blue">你将被净化，并可在一个月后再次参与这次评估。</span>”
      <br><br>
      <<link [[允许检验|RobinTemple Evaluation Examination]]>><</link>>
      <br>
      <<link [[拒绝检验|RobinTemple Evaluation Refuse]]>><</link>>
      <br>
      <<link [[坦白你不纯洁了|RobinTemple Evaluation Admit]]>><</link>>
      <br>
    <<else>>
      “很遗憾，<span class="red">你没有通过此次评估。</span>根据你的近期状况，我无法真心地让你们结合。<span class="blue">但是，你被允许在下个月再次进行评估。</span>”
      <br><br>
      <<link [[继续|RobinTemple Evaluation Fail]]>><</link>>
      <br>
    <</if>>
    <<unset $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks>><<unset $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer>>
<</language>>

:: RobinTemple Evaluation Fail
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<npc Robin 1>><<npc Jordan 2>><<person2>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<set $RobinTemple.stage to "member">>
    Jordan leads you back into the other room, where Robin waits. <<person1>><<He>> looks excited, but <<his>> expression quickly falters when <<he>> sees the look on your face.
    <br><br>
    "I'm sorry. I'll leave you two alone for as long as you need." Jordan begins to exit. "Should you need to talk, you know where to find me."
    <br><br>
    Robin takes you by the hand. "It's... it's okay. I... can wait. As long as it takes. I promise." <<His>> eyes begin to water. You pull <<him>> into a tight hug, and stay there for what feels like hours.
    <<tearful>> you exit back into the temple with <<him>>.
    <br><br>
    <<endevent>><<npc "Robin">><<person1>>
    <<templeicon 'quarters'>><<lanLink ['Return to Robin', '回到罗宾的座位'] 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<npc Robin 1>><<npc Jordan 2>><<person2>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<set $RobinTemple.stage to "member">>
    约旦将你带到罗宾在等待的那个房间。<<person1>><<He>>看起来很兴奋，但当注意到你的脸色时，表情迅速僵住了。
    <br><br>
    "我很抱歉。我会给你们二人空间，如果你们需要的话。"约旦转身离开，"如果你们想谈谈，你们知道我在哪里。"
    <br><br>
    罗宾牵起你的手。"没……没事。如果必要的话，我……我可以等。我保证。"只见<<His>>眼里涌上泪水，你一把将<<him>>紧紧抱在怀里，你们就这么待了很久很久。
    <<tearful>>你和<<him>>一起离开，返回了神殿。
    <br><br>
    <<endevent>><<npc "Robin">><<person1>>
    <<templeicon 'quarters'>><<lanLink ['Return to Robin', '回到罗宾的座位'] 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</language>>

:: RobinTemple Evaluation Refuse
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<effects>>
    "Then I must assume the worst," Jordan says, looking at <<his>> feet. "I'm sorry. You will be purified. I will summon the specialists. Please cooperate with them." <<He>> produces a small bell from <<his>> robes, and rings. "Robin will not be punished, or informed of this, for your sake."
    <br><br>
    <<endevent>>
    <<link [[Next|Temple Arcade Intro]]>><</link>>
    <br>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<effects>>
    "那我只能假设最糟的情况了，"约旦说着，一直盯着自己的脚尖，"很遗憾，你必须被净化。我会召集专人来，请一定配合。"<<He>>从斗篷里拿出一枚小铃，轻轻晃响了它。"考虑到你的感受，罗宾不会被净化，也不会知晓此事。"
    <br><br>
    <<endevent>>
    <<link [[继续|Temple Arcade Intro]]>><</link>>
    <br>
<</language>>

:: RobinTemple Evaluation Admit
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
      "I-it was taken from me," you say. "I'm sorry."
    <<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
      "No need," you say. "I failed your dumb task."
    <<else>>
      "I'm sorry," you say. "But I didn't remain chaste."
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    "Thank you for your honesty," Jordan says, looking at <<his>> feet. "You must be purified. I will summon the specialists. Please cooperate with them." <<He>> produces a small bell from <<his>> robes, and rings. "Robin will not be punished, or informed of this, for your sake."
    <br><br>
    <<endevent>>
    <<link [[Next|Temple Arcade Intro]]>><</link>>
    <br>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
      "我，我的贞洁，已经失去了，"你说，"抱歉。"
    <<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
      "不需要了，"你说，"我没通过你那白痴任务。"
    <<else>>
      "抱歉，"你说，"我没有保持贞洁。"
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    "谢谢你的坦诚，"约旦说着，一直盯着自己的脚尖，"你必须被净化。我会召集专人来，请一定要配合。"<<He>>从斗篷里拿出一枚小铃，轻轻晃响了它。"考虑到你的感受，罗宾不会被净化，也不会知晓此事。"
    <br><br>
    <<endevent>>
    <<link [[继续|Temple Arcade Intro]]>><</link>>
    <br>
<</language>>

:: RobinTemple Evaluation Contact
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<if $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase is 1>>
      Jordan nods. "I trust your words."
    <<else>>
      Jordan nods. "I appreciate your honesty."
    <</if>>
    <<He>> stands up.
    <br><br>
    "One final question. Have you had any sexual contact of any kind with <<nnpc_brother "Robin">> Robin?"
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Yes|RobinTemple Evaluation Result]]>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase to 1>><<stress 12>><</link>><<ggstress>>
    <br>
    <<link [[No|RobinTemple Evaluation Result]]>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase to 2>><</link>>
    <br>

  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<if $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase is 1>>
      约旦点点头。"我相信你的话。"
    <<else>>
      约旦点点头。"我欣赏你的诚实。"
    <</if>>
    <<He>>站起身来。
    <br><br>
    "最后一个问题。你有和罗宾<<nnpc_brother "Robin">>发生过任何类型的性行为吗？"
    <br><br>
    <<link [[有|RobinTemple Evaluation Result]]>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase to 1>><<stress 12>><</link>><<ggstress>>
    <br>
    <<link [[没有|RobinTemple Evaluation Result]]>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase to 2>><</link>>
    <br>

<</language>>

:: RobinTemple Evaluation Eavesdrop
<<effects>><<skulduggerycheck>><<skulduggeryuse>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You press your ear to the door. Jordan asks where you grew up together. "At the orphanage," Robin answers.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你把耳朵贴在门上。约旦问你们在哪里一起长大。“在孤儿院。”罗宾答道。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Eavesdrop Followup'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You were not quiet enough. Jordan opens the door and looks at you. "Please be patient. I will return shortly."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你没有足够小心。约旦打开门，看向你。“请耐心等待，我很快就回来。”
  <</language>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 10>><br><br>
  <<lanLink ['Next (0:15)', '继续 (0:15)'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Questions'>><<pass 15>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase to 2>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Evaluation Examination
