<<effects>><<npc Jordan 2>><<person2>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Jordan administers the off-schedule examination.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    约旦为你进行临时贞洁检查。
<</language>>

<<arousal 1000 "genitals">>
<<if ($player.virginity.penile is true and $player.virginity.vaginal is true) or $player.virginity.temple is true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "Congratulations. You are unblemished, and may it stay that way. This evaluation is complete, and you have passed."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “恭喜，你依然纯洁无瑕，希望你继续保持。评估结束了，你通过了。”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'RobinTemple Promise Rite'>><<set $RobinTemple.stage to 'approved'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<set $templetest to 'failed'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "I am sorry, but you must be purified. Robin will not be punished, or informed of this, for your sake."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “很抱歉，你需要接受净化。为了你，我不会惩罚罗宾，也不会告知罗宾此事。”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<endevent>><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Temple Arcade Intro'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Evaluation Eavesdrop Followup
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<effects>>
    "You understand the requirements and restrictions of the vow of promise?"
    <br>
    "Yes."
    <br>
    "Would you be willing to submit to an off-schedule chastity exam to prove your devotion and purity?"
    <br>
    "Of course."
    <br>
    "Excellent." Another pause.


    You hear something drop on the other side of the door, which startles you. You prepare to rush back to your seat, until you hear Jordan speak again.
    <br><br>
    "Have you had any sexual contact with <<phim>>?" There's a very long pause.
    <br>
    "Y...y...yes. Not... not anything that would have broken my vow, though."
    <br>
    "Thank you for being honest. I trust your word. Your section of this evaluation is complete."
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Next|RobinTemple Evaluation Questions]]>><<pass 15>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase to 3>><</link>>
    <br>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<effects>>
    "你应该明白承诺誓约的要求和限制吧？"
    <br>
    “是的。”
    <br>
    "那你愿意接受一个月检之外的贞洁测试来证明你的纯洁和虔诚吗？"
    <br>
    "当然。"
    <br>
    "很好。"又是一个停顿。


    你继续伏在门上偷听。另一侧似乎有什么东西掉了下来，吓得你连忙准备跑回座位，直到你听见约旦的声音再次响起。
    <br><br>
    "你有和<<phim>>发生过性行为吗？"一个长长的停顿。
    <br>
    "有……有……有过。但……但并没有到违背我誓约的程度。"
    <br>
    "谢谢你的坦诚，我信任你。你这部分的评估已经完成了。"
    <br><br>
    <<link [[继续|RobinTemple Evaluation Questions]]>><<pass 15>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase to 3>><</link>>
    <br>
<</language>>
